@Laura Lopez @Ania Safko – Wanted to flag some concerns I have around having a modal prompting the user if they want to close associated tabs. 

It can get annoying if we prompt this each time a user removes a task/or a series of tasks. 

If we have a never show this again option, then we end up with 2 check boxes (remember my choice, never show again).
